/T (Wagguv mats are traditional Kashmiri floor mats made by weaving reed grass from ponds and waterways or from dried rice straw.  They are soft, eco-friendly, and keep homes warm in winter and cool in summer. The craft is about 300 years old.Traditionally, these mats were used in almost every mosque, shrine and Kashmiri home.    )
/E (Wagguv mats are traditional Kashmiri floor mats made by weaving reed grass from ponds and waterways or from dried rice straw.  They are soft, eco-friendly, and keep homes warm in winter and cool in summer. The craft is about 300 years old.Traditionally, these mats were used in almost every mosque, shrine and Kashmiri home.    )
